  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201c;La Casita de Nazaria&#x201d; project in Argentina, implemented by Bajar a la Calle is a free care centre for the children of young mothers attending secondary school at night. It is located within a school in Villa Soldati (Buenos Aires) and it offers educational, emotional, and food support to children. The main beneficiaries are: 35 children aged from 6 months to 5 years old, who will receive care, early education, food, and emotional support each evening. Also, 25 young mothers who will continue or complete their secondary education thanks to the childcare provided.</narrative>
  </description>
